From a736a73f94378dcf2695500b22b468498d447fb0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 09:43:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Read an album's releases in one statement, each with its
 parts nested

The album page ran about ten statements for every release it held. Each
release is now one row of a single statement whose columns carry its
track groups, credits, files, records, unstored audio, upload and cover
as JSON, so the count stays the same however many releases the album has.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
